    "enUS": {
      "description": "The sergeant's eyes light up as he notices your bottle of Thunder Applejack...",
      "dialogue": {
        "0c586fa9e2a46ca9d13c": "Do my eyes deceive me? I haven't seen a drop of Thunder Applejack in months!\nThis should put a smile on the troops' faces. You have my thanks, $c!",
